WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.488 --> 00:00:03.240
(fireworks exploding)

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.880
- [Reporter 1] Small
crowds in Eastern Ukraine's

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.320
breakaway regions
celebrated Russian President

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.320
Vladimir Putin's decision to recognize

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.853
their independence on Monday.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.570
- To recognize these territories,

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.400
which are on Ukraine side of the border

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.790
as Russian territories

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.910
that gives him a pretext to send in troops

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:25.924
because the pro-Russian
authorities in these two areas

00:00:25.924 --> 00:00:28.400
say that they feel like
they're under threat

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.510
from the Kiev government

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:31.830
and can Russia please protect them.

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:32.890
- [Reporter 1] Western authorities say

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:37.560
Russia has massed as many as
190,000 troops around Ukraine.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:40.120
Now Putin has ordered what
he calls peacekeeping forces

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.880
to enter the breakaway regions

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:43.550
in response to what the Kremlin says

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.603
is aggression by Ukrainian forces.

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:49.380
Tanks were photographed
in the city of Donetsk

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:51.700
and witnesses said
Russian military vehicles

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.420
poured in early Tuesday.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.090
Local authorities didn't immediately

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:57.193
confirm the arrival of Russian troops.

00:00:58.126 --> 00:01:00.740
- (foreign language)

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:03.520
- This is a major escalation

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.810
because he's sending Russian troops

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:07.950
onto the territory of a sovereign country,

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:09.170
that is Ukraine.

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:11.740
It threatens to end the negotiations

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:16.220
that have been going on
for weeks now in Europe,

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:19.260
aimed at trying to get him to de-escalate

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:20.823
the situation at the border.

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.340
- [Reporter 1] Russia said
it's still open to diplomacy,

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:26.170
but Putin's move further complicated

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:28.040
those efforts to find a solution

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:31.090
and triggered a wave of
condemnation among world leaders.

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:35.250
- This is plainly in breach
of international law.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:38.180
Russia should step back.

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:40.260
- [Reporter 1] Ukrainian
President Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:42.160
discussed the crisis with President Biden

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.607
and addressed the nation.

00:01:43.607 --> 00:01:46.690
- (foreign language)

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:52.870
- [Reporter 1] After Putin's announcement,

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:54.860
President Biden signed an executive order

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:57.030
that will prohibit US
investments and trade

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:58.930
in the breakaway regions.

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:03.930
- So this is not the
big salvo of sanctions

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:06.510
that the US and Europe
have been promising.

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:07.930
Those could still come.

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:09.930
It's limited, probably,

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:12.310
because they wanna hold
that stuff in their quiver.

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:13.480
If President Putin decides

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:15.840
to invade the rest of the country.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:17.320
- [Reporter 1] The US Senates
allies have threatened

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:20.380
to unleash potentially crippling
sanctions against Russia.

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:22.720
Targeting its major
banks, state companies,

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:25.150
and key imports if it invades Ukraine.

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:26.670
- I think that we can expect

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:31.400
to see more efforts at
Hail Mary diplomacy.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.370
But on the other hand, we could see

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:36.140
President Putin escalating further

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:39.980
and sending troops into the
rest of Ukraine and taking Kiev.

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:43.610
Or we could also see the
kind of cyber attacks

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:45.610
that the US Intelligence

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:47.474
and the US Government has been expecting.

00:02:47.474 --> 00:02:50.557
- (foreign language)

